    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a black hole lately. everything i touch just gets heavy and dark. i look at my partner and i can see how tired they are of carrying me... like i'm just draining the life out of them. honestly, everyone would be so much happier if i just weren't a factor anymore.",
