      "content": "but that's just more work for them. more \"stabilizing\" me, more \"supporting\" me... it never ends. it's just a cycle of them giving and me taking. i hate that my existence is basically just a chore for them now. i just want to stop being the reason they're suffering. it feels so much kinder to just let them be free of me.",
